p.src:
Each tensor index contributes its own connection term. With the standard sign convention, every lower index contributes a minus sign and every upper index contributes a plus sign. For a rank-two covariant tensor, $\boxed{
  \nabla_p T_{mn}
  =
  \partial_p T_{mn}
  -
  \Gamma^r{}_{pm}T_{rn}
  -
  \Gamma^r{}_{pn}T_{mr}.}$

