p.src:
For a vector, the ordinary derivative along the curve is still not tensorial. We first take the covariant derivative and then contract its derivative index with the tangent: $\boxed{
  \frac{D V^n}{Ds}
  \equiv
  t^m\nabla_m V^n.}$

