A geodesic is an affinely parameterized curve whose tangent vector is covariantly constant: $\boxed{
  \frac{D t^n}{Ds}=0.}$ Equivalently, $\boxed{
  \frac{d^2y^n}{ds^2}
  +
  \Gamma^n{}_{mr}
  \frac{dy^m}{ds}
  \frac{dy^r}{ds}
  =
  0.}$

